{
  "an3.69:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.69 ",
  "an3.69:0.2": "7. Mahāvagga ",
  "an3.69:0.3": "Akusalamūlasutta ",
  "an3.69:1.1": "“Tīṇimāni, bhikkhave, akusalamūlāni. ",
  "an3.69:1.2": "Katamāni tīṇi? ",
  "an3.69:1.3": "Lobho akusalamūlaṁ, doso akusalamūlaṁ, moho akusalamūlaṁ. ",
  "an3.69:2.1": "Yadapi, bhikkhave, lobho tadapi akusalamūlaṁ; ",
  "an3.69:2.2": "yadapi luddho abhisaṅkharoti kāyena vācāya manasā tadapi akusalaṁ; ",
  "an3.69:2.3": "yadapi luddho lobhena abhibhūto pariyādinnacitto parassa asatā dukkhaṁ uppādayati vadhena vā bandhanena vā jāniyā vā garahāya vā pabbājanāya vā balavamhi balattho itipi tadapi akusalaṁ. ",
  "an3.69:2.4": "Itissame lobhajā lobhanidānā lobhasamudayā lobhapaccayā aneke pāpakā akusalā dhammā sambhavanti. ",
  "an3.69:3.1": "Yadapi, bhikkhave, doso tadapi akusalamūlaṁ; ",
  "an3.69:3.2": "yadapi duṭṭho abhisaṅkharoti kāyena vācāya manasā tadapi akusalaṁ; ",
  "an3.69:3.3": "yadapi duṭṭho dosena abhibhūto pariyādinnacitto parassa asatā dukkhaṁ uppādayati vadhena vā bandhanena vā jāniyā vā garahāya vā pabbājanāya vā balavamhi balattho itipi tadapi akusalaṁ. ",
  "an3.69:3.4": "Itissame dosajā dosanidānā dosasamudayā dosapaccayā aneke pāpakā akusalā dhammā sambhavanti. ",
  "an3.69:4.1": "Yadapi, bhikkhave, moho tadapi akusalamūlaṁ; ",
  "an3.69:4.2": "yadapi mūḷho abhisaṅkharoti kāyena vācāya manasā tadapi akusalaṁ; ",
  "an3.69:4.3": "yadapi mūḷh